      "transcript_text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with heart failure with some fluid on board at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've been getting breathless lying flat, since this morning, and no chest pain or palpitations.",
